# Machine-written files: always check out with LF line endings, matching what
# generate-index.js and the admin tool's GitHub commits write. Without this,
# a Windows checkout (CRLF) differs byte-for-byte from what every local build
# writes (LF), so ~160 JSON-LD files show up as "modified" after each build
# even though their content is identical.
*.jsonld              text eol=lf
sections/**/*.json    text eol=lf
